Hello,

FYI, a new TCP-in-UDP tool is available, using eBPF to translate TCP
packets into UDP to avoid middleboxes interfering with some TCP
extensions like MPTCP.

Blog post explaining why it has been created, and its particularities:

  https://blog.mptcp.dev/2025/07/14/TCP-in-UDP.html

Code and instructions:

  https://github.com/multipath-tcp/tcp-in-udp

Enjoy!

Cheers,
Matt

